# Day 1 Complete

The screen goes quiet.

**Love: {love}**

Kazu knows Yume doesn't like him the way he likes her.

Not yet, anyway.

She brushes off his flirting.

She leaves when she wants to.

She doesn't owe him anything.

But she came back tonight just to talk.

For now, that's enough.

Maybe he has a chance.

